WEBVTT

00:07:58.599 --> 00:08:00.392
As much as I want to protect my kids,

00:08:00.392 --> 00:08:04.355
I know encouraging them to opt out
is not the answer.

00:08:05.397 --> 00:08:07.608
So I don't want my kids
in the digital fray

00:08:07.608 --> 00:08:09.401
until they know who they are.

00:08:09.401 --> 00:08:13.864
But you develop your sense of self
by participating in the world.

00:08:13.864 --> 00:08:17.117
So I try to help them discover themselves
through these technologies,

00:08:17.117 --> 00:08:18.410
not despite them.

00:08:19.328 --> 00:08:24.208
And I give myself that same protection
and motherly advice

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.752
by honoring two main principles.

00:08:28.504 --> 00:08:30.881
The two day delay.